## Quick start

```bash
cp .env.example .env
docker compose up -d
./scripts/seed-db.sh
open http://{{HOSTNAME}}:{{WP_PORT}}
```

Add once to `/etc/hosts`:

```
127.0.0.1  {{HOSTNAME}}
```

